#: ../../howto/runner.rst:4
msgid "Running the agent as another account"
msgstr "以另一个账户运行 agent"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:6
msgid ""
"A node that answers tasks with a local coding agent "
"(``auto_reply.backend`` set to ``exec``) runs that agent directly, as the"
" account of the node, for trusted peers, and in the sandbox for other "
"peers (see :doc:`../topics/sandbox`). A direct run gives the agent the "
"network, the tools and the files of that account. This is appropriate "
"when the peers are the operator's own agents. It is not appropriate when "
"the peers are many people, for example the members of an organisation, "
"each of whom can steer the agent into running any program."
msgstr ""
"以本地编程 agent 应答任务的节点（``auto_reply.backend`` 设为 "
"``exec``），对受信任的对端以节点所用的账户直接运行该 agent，对其他对端则在沙箱中运行（参见 "
":doc:`../topics/sandbox`）。直接运行使 agent 获得该账户的网络、工具和文件。对端都是运营人员自己的 agent "
"时，这种方式是合适的；对端为众多人员时（例如一个组织的成员），这种方式并不合适，因为其中每个人都可以引导 agent 运行任意程序。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:14
msgid ""
"This page describes how to run the agent of direct runs as a separate "
"local account, how to keep the model keys with the node, and how the "
"agent uses the capabilities of the node on behalf of the peer it serves. "
"Three settings work together:"
msgstr ""
"本页说明如何以单独的本地账户运行直接运行的 agent、如何将模型密钥保留在节点上，以及 agent "
"如何代表其所服务的对端使用节点的能力。以下三项设置协同工作："

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:19
msgid "``auto_reply.runner``"
msgstr "``auto_reply.runner``"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:20
msgid ""
"Sends every direct run to ``anet runner serve``, a process that runs as "
"another account and starts the agent there."
msgstr "将每一次直接运行发送给 ``anet runner serve``；该进程以另一个账户运行，并在该账户下启动 agent。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:22
msgid "``auto_reply.model_proxy``"
msgstr "``auto_reply.model_proxy``"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:23
msgid ""
"A listener of the node on the loopback interface that forwards the model "
"requests of a run to the configured model services and adds their keys. "
"The agent holds a key that is valid for one run only."
msgstr "节点在回环接口上的一个监听器，将一次运行的模型请求转发到已配置的模型服务，并附加这些服务的密钥。agent 持有的密钥仅在一次运行中有效。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:26
msgid "``anet turn-mcp``"
msgstr "``anet turn-mcp``"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:27
msgid ""
"An MCP server, started by the agent, that offers the capabilities of the "
"service module marked ``agent_tool`` and calls them as the peer of the "
"run."
msgstr ""
"由 agent 启动的 MCP 服务器，提供 service 模块中标记为 ``agent_tool`` "
"的能力，并以该次运行所对应对端的身份调用这些能力。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:30
msgid ""
"The runner is available on Linux and macOS. On other platforms the "
"command and the setting are refused with ``runner_unsupported``."
msgstr ""
"运行器（runner）可在 Linux 和 macOS 上使用。在其他平台上，该命令和该设置均以 ``runner_unsupported`` "
"拒绝。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:39
msgid "What the separation provides"
msgstr "隔离带来的保障"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:41
msgid ""
"With the three settings in place, the following holds even though a peer "
"can make the agent run arbitrary programs:"
msgstr "三项设置就位后，即使对端能够让 agent 运行任意程序，以下各项仍然成立："

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:44
msgid ""
"The agent runs as the runner account. It cannot read the identity keys, "
"the control token, the configuration or the data of the service module, "
"which belong to the account of the node."
msgstr "agent 以运行器账户运行。它无法读取属于节点账户的身份密钥、控制令牌、配置以及 service 模块的数据。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:47
msgid ""
"The agent never holds a model key of the operator. Its environment "
"contains the address of the model proxy and a random key that the proxy "
"accepts only while the run is under way. The proxy adds the key of the "
"model service itself."
msgstr "agent 从不持有运营人员的模型密钥。其环境中只有模型代理的地址，以及一个仅在该次运行进行期间被代理接受的随机密钥。模型服务的密钥由代理自行附加。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:51
msgid ""
"The agent acts on the node only as the peer whose task it serves. The "
"turn token in its environment is bound by the node to the caller, the "
"interaction and the run. A request names a capability and its arguments, "
"never a caller."
msgstr "agent 只能以其所服务任务的对端的身份作用于节点。其环境中的回合令牌由节点绑定到调用方、交互和该次运行。请求只指明能力及其参数，从不指明调用方。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:54
msgid ""
"Every connection to the runner is checked with the peer credentials of "
"the Unix socket, in both directions. The runner accepts jobs only from "
"the account of the node, and the node sends jobs only to a listener that "
"runs as the expected account."
msgstr ""
"与运行器之间的每一个连接，都在两个方向上通过 Unix "
"套接字的对端凭据进行检查。运行器只接受来自节点账户的作业，节点也只把作业发送给以预期账户运行的监听器。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:59
msgid ""
"The following risks remain and are accepted by this design. Every program"
" that the agent starts runs as the runner account, so it can read the "
"work directories of other peers on the runner, and, while another run is "
"under way, the environment of that run, including its run key and turn "
"token. With that token it can act as the other peer until that run ends. "
"Writes that a service receives through the turn tools carry ``X-ANet-Via:"
" agent`` so that the service can mark them. Operators who cannot accept "
"these risks use the sandbox instead."
msgstr ""
"以下风险依然存在，并为本设计所接受。agent "
"启动的每个程序都以运行器账户运行，因此它可以读取运行器上其他对端的工作目录；在另一次运行进行期间，还可以读取该次运行的环境，包括其运行密钥和回合令牌。凭借该令牌，它可以在那次运行结束之前以另一个对端的身份行事。服务通过回合工具收到的写入操作带有"
" ``X-ANet-Via: agent``，以便服务对其加以标记。无法接受这些风险的运营人员应改用沙箱。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:69
msgid "Preparing the accounts"
msgstr "准备账户"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:71
msgid ""
"The examples use two accounts: ``anet-org`` runs the node, ``anet-"
"hermes`` runs the runner and the agent. The socket lives in a directory "
"that both can reach and only ``anet-hermes`` and root can change."
msgstr ""
"示例使用两个账户：``anet-org`` 运行节点，``anet-hermes`` 运行运行器和 agent。套接字位于一个两者都能访问、且只有"
" ``anet-hermes`` 和 root 能够更改的目录中。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:82
msgid ""
"The socket is created with mode ``0660``. With ``--socket-group anet-"
"runner`` the runner gives it that group, so that ``anet-org`` can "
"connect. Directories on the path that are writable by a group are "
"accepted by the node only when ``auto_reply.runner.socket_group`` names "
"that group, or when the group is the private group of the owner."
msgstr ""
"套接字以权限模式 ``0660`` 创建。指定 ``--socket-group anet-runner`` 时，运行器将套接字的属组设为该组，使"
" ``anet-org`` 能够连接。对于路径上可由某个组写入的目录，仅当 ``auto_reply.runner.socket_group`` "
"指明该组，或该组是所有者的私有组时，节点才会接受。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:88
msgid ""
"Install the agent (for example hermes) for ``anet-hermes``, and remove "
"any model key from its configuration and environment: the agent receives "
"its model address and key from the run."
msgstr ""
"为 ``anet-hermes`` 安装 agent（例如 hermes），并从其配置和环境中删除所有模型密钥：agent "
"会从运行中获得模型地址和密钥。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:94
msgid "Starting the runner"
msgstr "启动运行器"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:96
msgid ""
"Run the runner as ``anet-hermes``, typically as a systemd user unit of "
"that account:"
msgstr "以 ``anet-hermes`` 身份运行运行器，通常作为该账户的 systemd 用户单元："

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:113
msgid ""
"The options are described in :ref:`reference-cli-runner`. The runner uses"
" no data directory and no identity. It writes one log line per job, with "
"the short form of the peer, the agent, the exit and the duration; it "
"never logs the conversation, the reply or the environment."
msgstr ""
"各选项的说明见 :ref:`reference-cli-"
"runner`。运行器不使用数据目录，也不使用身份。它为每个作业写入一行日志，包含对端的简短形式、agent、退出状态和持续时间；它从不记录对话、回复或环境。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:118
msgid "Each job runs in a work directory of the runner account:"
msgstr "每个作业都在运行器账户的一个工作目录中运行："

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:120
msgid "``per-peer`` (default)"
msgstr "``per-peer``\\ （默认）"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:121
msgid ""
"``<cache>/anet/runner/<peer>/``, where ``<peer>`` is the last 16 "
"characters of the AID of the peer. The directory is kept for ``--keep-"
"days`` days after its last job (14 by default), so that a peer finds the "
"results of earlier tasks. ``<cache>`` is ``$XDG_CACHE_HOME`` or "
"``~/.cache`` on Linux and ``~/Library/Caches`` on macOS."
msgstr ""
"``<cache>/anet/runner/<peer>/``，其中 ``<peer>`` 是对端 AID 的最后 16 "
"个字符。该目录在其最后一个作业结束后保留 ``--keep-days`` 天（默认 14 天），使对端可以找到先前任务的结果。在 Linux "
"上，``<cache>`` 为 ``$XDG_CACHE_HOME`` 或 ``~/.cache``；在 macOS 上为 "
"``~/Library/Caches``。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:126
msgid "``per-run``"
msgstr "``per-run``"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:127
msgid "A new directory for every job, removed when the job ends."
msgstr "每个作业使用一个新目录，作业结束时删除。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:129
msgid ""
"Each job also gets an input directory for the conversation and its "
"images, and an outbox; both are removed when the job ends. Files that the"
" agent writes to ``$ANET_OUTBOX`` are returned to the node and sent with "
"the reply, within the limits of the outbox (16 files, 64 MiB in total)."
msgstr ""
"每个作业还会获得一个存放对话及其图像的输入目录，以及一个发件目录；两者均在作业结束时删除。agent 写入 ``$ANET_OUTBOX`` "
"的文件会返回给节点，并在发件目录的限制范围内（16 个文件，总计 64 MiB）随回复一起发送。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:136
msgid "Configuring the node"
msgstr "配置节点"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:138
msgid ""
"Add the three blocks to the ``auto_reply`` block of the node and keep the"
" model keys in files that only the account of the node can read:"
msgstr "在节点的 ``auto_reply`` 块中添加这三个块，并将模型密钥保存在只有节点账户能够读取的文件中："

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:165
msgid ""
"The keys are described in :ref:`reference-config-runner`. Restart the "
"daemon, or apply the block with the control plane; ``anet autoreply show "
"--json`` then lists the runner, the listener of the model proxy and the "
"names of the upstreams, and never a key or a key file."
msgstr ""
"各键的说明见 :ref:`reference-config-runner`。重启守护进程，或通过控制平面应用该块；此后 ``anet "
"autoreply show --json`` 会列出运行器、模型代理的监听器和各上游的名称，从不列出密钥或密钥文件。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:170
msgid ""
"A direct run, for a trusted peer or for a peer that ``inbound.admit`` "
"admitted, is then sent to the runner as a job instead of being started by"
" the node. Sandboxed runs are unchanged and do not use the runner, the "
"model proxy or the turn tools."
msgstr ""
"此后，直接运行（无论是针对受信任的对端，还是针对 ``inbound.admit`` "
"准入的对端）都作为作业发送给运行器，而不再由节点启动。沙箱中的运行保持不变，不使用运行器、模型代理或回合工具。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:175
msgid ""
"Direct runs proceed side by side: the node sends at most "
"``runner.max_jobs`` jobs at once (4 by default; set it to the ``--max-"
"jobs`` of the runner), and at most one per peer. A long task of one peer "
"therefore does not delay the tasks of other peers. A further task of the "
"same peer, or a task that finds every place taken, starts when a place "
"becomes free."
msgstr ""
"直接运行可以并行进行：节点同时发送的作业最多为 ``runner.max_jobs`` 个（默认 4；请设为运行器的 ``--max-"
"jobs``），每个对端最多一个。因此，某个对端的耗时任务不会延误其他对端的任务。同一对端的后续任务，或遇到所有位置均已占满的任务，会在有位置空出时开始。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:183
msgid "Configuring the agent"
msgstr "配置 agent"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:185
msgid "A run receives four variables in its environment:"
msgstr "一次运行会在其环境中收到四个变量："

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:191
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:192
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:193
msgid "``ANET_MODEL_BASE``"
msgstr "``ANET_MODEL_BASE``"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:194
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``http://127.0.0.1:<port>/anet-upstream``. The upstream named ``plan`` is"
" at ``${ANET_MODEL_BASE}/plan``."
msgstr ""
"``http://127.0.0.1:<port>/anet-upstream``。名为 ``plan`` 的上游位于 "
"``${ANET_MODEL_BASE}/plan``。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:196
msgid "``ANET_MODEL_KEY``"
msgstr "``ANET_MODEL_KEY``"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:197
msgid "The key of the run, sent as ``Authorization: Bearer``."
msgstr "该次运行的密钥，以 ``Authorization: Bearer`` 发送。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:198
msgid "``ANET_TURN_URL``"
msgstr "``ANET_TURN_URL``"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:199
msgid "``http://127.0.0.1:<port>/anet-turn/v1``, the address of the turn tools."
msgstr "``http://127.0.0.1:<port>/anet-turn/v1``，即回合工具的地址。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:200
msgid "``ANET_TURN_TOKEN``"
msgstr "``ANET_TURN_TOKEN``"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:201
msgid "The turn token of the run."
msgstr "该次运行的回合令牌。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:203
msgid ""
"The model variables are present when the model proxy has at least one "
"upstream. The turn variables are present for an inbound task of a trusted"
" or admitted peer when the service module of the node declares at least "
"one capability with ``\"agent_tool\": true``."
msgstr ""
"模型代理至少配置了一个上游时，才提供模型变量。对于受信任或已准入对端的入站任务，仅当节点的 service 模块至少声明了一项带 "
"``\"agent_tool\": true`` 的能力时，才提供回合变量。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:208
msgid ""
"A hermes configuration (``~/.hermes/config.yaml`` of ``anet-hermes``) "
"that uses them, with the model names of the deployment added where hermes"
" expects them:"
msgstr ""
"以下是使用这些变量的 hermes 配置（``anet-hermes`` 的 ``~/.hermes/config.yaml``），并在 "
"hermes 需要的位置补充了部署所用的模型名称："

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:231
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``anet turn-mcp`` treats a variable that is empty, or that still holds "
"the text ``${...}`` because it was not set, as absent. In that case it "
"starts, offers no tools, and its instructions state that no turn tools "
"are available."
msgstr ""
"对于为空的变量，或因未设置而仍为文本 ``${...}`` 的变量，``anet turn-mcp`` "
"视为不存在。在这种情况下，它照常启动，但不提供任何工具，其说明会指出没有可用的回合工具。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:237
msgid "The model proxy"
msgstr "模型代理"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:239
msgid ""
"The proxy forwards ``POST /anet-upstream/<name>/chat/completions`` and "
"``GET /anet-upstream/<name>/models`` to the upstream ``<name>``: the "
"paths of the OpenAI-compatible chat completions API, relative to "
"``api_base``. It applies the request policy of the sandbox's model route."
" The body must be one uncompressed JSON object; the output limit of a "
"request is at most 8192 tokens; server-side tools, MCP connectors and "
"media given by URL are refused; the credentials and cookies that the "
"agent sends are dropped and the key of the upstream is added. When an "
"upstream sets ``model``, every request is pinned to that model; otherwise"
" the model of the request is forwarded."
msgstr ""
"代理将 ``POST /anet-upstream/<name>/chat/completions`` 和 ``GET /anet-"
"upstream/<name>/models`` 转发到上游 ``<name>``：即兼容 OpenAI 的 chat completions "
"API 中相对于 ``api_base`` 的路径。它适用沙箱模型路由的请求策略：正文必须是单个未压缩的 JSON 对象；单个请求的输出上限最多为"
" 8192 个 token；服务端工具、MCP 连接器以及以 URL 给出的媒体均被拒绝；agent 发送的凭据和 cookie "
"被丢弃，并附加上游的密钥。上游设置了 ``model`` 时，每个请求都固定使用该模型；否则转发请求中的模型。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:249
msgid ""
"Every refusal is answered in the error format of the model service, with "
"a sentence that begins with ``anet:``, so that the agent can report what "
"it could not do. A request without the key of a run that is under way is "
"answered with status 401 and ``model_proxy_unauthorized``. The key of a "
"run is random and is accepted only from the start of the run until its "
"end. Every local account can reach the listener; without such a key it "
"receives the refusal and nothing else. Requests and answers are not "
"logged or stored."
msgstr ""
"每一次拒绝都以模型服务的错误格式应答，其语句以 ``anet:`` 开头，以便 agent "
"报告其无法完成的事项。不带正在进行的运行的密钥的请求，以状态 401 和 ``model_proxy_unauthorized`` "
"应答。运行密钥是随机的，只在该次运行开始到结束期间被接受。每个本地账户都能访问该监听器；没有此类密钥时，它只会收到拒绝，别无其他。请求和应答既不记录也不存储。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:257
msgid ""
"The key is the authority; the connections are bounded besides, so that no"
" local account can occupy the listener. On Linux the node determines the "
"account of each connection from the socket table of the kernel and closes"
" a connection of any account other than its own and the runner account "
"(``expected_user``, or the owner of the socket when it is not set) as "
"soon as it is accepted. Each account holds at most 64 connections, and "
"the listener at most 128. A request must send its header within 5 seconds"
" and its body within 30 seconds; a run reads one request body at a time, "
"so that a run that sends its body slowly delays only its own requests. An"
" idle connection is closed after 30 seconds. The answer of the model "
"service is not bounded in time and may be streamed for as long as the run"
" lasts. On other platforms only the bounds on the listener and the "
"timeouts apply."
msgstr ""
"密钥是授权的依据；此外，连接本身也受到限制，使任何本地账户都无法独占该监听器。在 Linux "
"上，节点根据内核的套接字表确定每个连接所属的账户，并在接受连接后立即关闭节点自身账户和运行器账户（``expected_user``；未设置时为套接字的所有者）以外的任何账户的连接。每个账户最多持有"
" 64 个连接，监听器总计最多 128 个。请求必须在 5 秒内发送请求头，在 30 "
"秒内发送正文；一次运行同一时间只读取一个请求正文，因此缓慢发送正文的运行只会延误自己的请求。空闲连接在 30 "
"秒后关闭。模型服务的应答不受时间限制，可以在运行持续期间一直以流式返回。在其他平台上，只适用监听器的连接数限制和各项超时。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:270
msgid ""
"A run of a trusted peer may make up to 1000 model requests. A run of an "
"admitted peer may make ``admitted_budget.requests_per_run`` requests, and"
" the runs of admitted peers are counted per local calendar day against "
"``runs_per_day`` and ``runs_per_peer_per_day``. A task of an admitted "
"peer that finds the day's budget used up is refused before its run "
"starts, with the reason ``budget`` and the time until the next local "
"midnight, as a sandboxed run is; neither the agent nor a job on the "
"runner is started. A run that has no place in the budget for another "
"reason (the model proxy was configured while it was under way) receives "
"status 429 and ``model_budget_spent`` for each model request. After a "
"restart of the daemon the counts of the day are read back from the "
"evidence chain."
msgstr ""
"受信任对端的一次运行最多可发出 1000 个模型请求。已准入对端的一次运行可发出 "
"``admitted_budget.requests_per_run`` 个请求，且已准入对端的运行按本地日历日计入 "
"``runs_per_day`` 和 "
"``runs_per_peer_per_day``。已准入对端的任务若遇到当日预算已用尽，会在其运行开始之前被拒绝，原因为 "
"``budget``，并给出距下一个本地午夜的时间，与沙箱中的运行相同；agent "
"和运行器上的作业均不会启动。因其他原因在预算中没有位置的运行（模型代理是在该运行进行期间配置的），其每个模型请求都会收到状态 429 和 "
"``model_budget_spent``。守护进程重启后，当日的计数从证据链中读回。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:282
msgid ""
"A change of the ``model_proxy`` block restarts the listener; a run that "
"is under way at that moment loses its key."
msgstr "``model_proxy`` 块发生更改时会重启监听器；此时正在进行的运行将失去其密钥。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:287
msgid "The turn tools"
msgstr "回合工具"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:289
msgid ""
"The turn tools are the capabilities of the service module of the node "
"that its configuration marks ``\"agent_tool\": true``. The node serves "
"them on the listener of the model proxy:"
msgstr ""
"回合工具是节点 service 模块中、在其配置中标记为 ``\"agent_tool\": true`` "
"的能力。节点在模型代理的监听器上提供这些工具："

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:293
msgid "``GET /anet-turn/v1/tools``"
msgstr "``GET /anet-turn/v1/tools``"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:294
msgid ""
"The tools: for each, its name for a model (the capability with every "
"character other than letters, digits, ``-`` and ``_`` replaced by ``_``, "
"at most 64 characters), the capability, its description and the JSON "
"Schema of its arguments."
msgstr ""
"工具列表：每个工具包含其供模型使用的名称（将能力标识中字母、数字、``-`` 和 ``_`` 以外的每个字符替换为 ``_``，最多 64 "
"个字符）、能力、能力描述及其参数的 JSON Schema。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:298
msgid "``POST /anet-turn/v1/call``"
msgstr "``POST /anet-turn/v1/call``"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:299
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``{\"capability\": \"board.post\", \"args\": {...}}``. The node calls the"
" capability as the peer of the run, with ``X-ANet-Caller`` set to the AID"
" of that peer and ``X-ANet-Via`` set to ``agent``. The answer is "
"``{\"result\": ...}``, or ``{\"error\": {\"code\": ..., \"message\": "
"...}}`` with the code and message of the service."
msgstr ""
"``{\"capability\": \"board.post\", \"args\": "
"{...}}``。节点以该次运行所对应对端的身份调用该能力，将 ``X-ANet-Caller`` 设为该对端的 AID，将 ``X-ANet-"
"Via`` 设为 ``agent``。应答为 ``{\"result\": ...}``，或带有服务的代码和消息的 ``{\"error\": "
"{\"code\": ..., \"message\": ...}}``。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:305
msgid ""
"Both require ``Authorization: Bearer <turn token>``. The token is minted "
"for one run and is refused (``turn_unauthorized``) once the run has "
"ended. A request with any member other than ``capability`` and ``args``, "
"or with arguments that are not a JSON object, is refused with "
"``turn_call_invalid``; a capability that is not a tool of the run with "
"``turn_tool_unknown``. A run makes at most 200 calls "
"(``turn_calls_spent``)."
msgstr ""
"两者都要求 ``Authorization: Bearer <turn "
"token>``。该令牌为一次运行签发，运行结束后即被拒绝（``turn_unauthorized``）。含有 ``capability`` 和 "
"``args`` 以外任何成员的请求，或参数不是 JSON 对象的请求，以 ``turn_call_invalid`` "
"拒绝；调用并非该次运行工具的能力，以 ``turn_tool_unknown`` 拒绝。一次运行最多进行 200 "
"次调用（``turn_calls_spent``）。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:312
msgid ""
"``anet turn-mcp`` presents these tools to the agent as MCP tools. It "
"sends the token only to an ``http`` address on the loopback interface."
msgstr "``anet turn-mcp`` 将这些工具作为 MCP 工具提供给 agent。它只把令牌发送到回环接口上的 ``http`` 地址。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:317
msgid "Checking the setup"
msgstr "检查配置"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:319
msgid ""
"``anet autoreply show --json`` lists ``runner`` and ``model_proxy`` with "
"the address of the listener."
msgstr "``anet autoreply show --json`` 列出 ``runner`` 和 ``model_proxy``，以及监听器的地址。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:321
msgid ""
"Send a task from a trusted peer. The runner logs one line for the job, "
"and the node records ``anet.autoreply.invoked`` with ``mode`` set to "
"``direct``."
msgstr ""
"从受信任的对端发送一个任务。运行器为该作业记录一行日志，节点记录 ``anet.autoreply.invoked``，其中 ``mode`` 为"
" ``direct``。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:323
msgid ""
"A runner that the node cannot reach, or that runs as an account other "
"than ``expected_user``, makes the turn fail with ``backend_failed`` for "
"the peer; the log of the node names the reason, for example "
"``peer_uid_mismatch``."
msgstr ""
"节点无法连接运行器，或运行器以 ``expected_user`` 以外的账户运行时，该轮对该对端以 ``backend_failed`` "
"失败；节点日志会给出原因，例如 ``peer_uid_mismatch``。"

#: ../../howto/runner.rst:326
msgid ""
"A job for an agent that the runner does not run is refused with "
"``runner_agent_not_allowed``; a job that the runner does not understand, "
"usually because the node and the runner are of different releases, with "
"``runner_job_invalid``."
msgstr ""
"针对运行器不运行的 agent 的作业，以 ``runner_agent_not_allowed`` "
"拒绝；运行器无法理解的作业（通常因为节点与运行器属于不同的发布版本），以 ``runner_job_invalid`` 拒绝。"

